java has 3 components

1) JDK: (java development kit)
     -used by the developers to create java applications
     -include: (Tools, Libraries, Compiler)
  
2) JRE: (java run-time environment)
     -used by end users.
     -provide runtime environment for running java applications.
     -include: (Byte code verifier, Libraries, but not include development tools)
    
3) JVM: (java virtual machine)
     -convert byte code into platform specific code available for all platforms.
     -include: (Interpreter, JIT-compiler, garbage collector)
